{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>Elohim has gathered up my reproach.</b> Like the meaning of כרת, and likewise \"and gladness and joy are gathered up\" (Isaiah 16:10). Others said that HaShem saw the reproaches that the women taunted me with on account of my being barren, and it is as though they were gathered and combined before HaShem. Now Jacob had 12 sons born in 7 years, and when the early ones counted them they found them to be six months and days in number. It is possible that Leah gave her maidservant to Jacob before Naphtali was born, and Rachel also conceived before Zebulun was born, and also Dinah — we do not know when she was born:"], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:46:24.439954630Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}